config BR2_PACKAGE_DODAKVARTER
	bool "dodakvarter"
	default y
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBDRM
	help
	  Döda Kvarter, ROCKNIXDS's zombie roguelike made for both screens (the top the game, the bottom the
	  inventory), on its own tile on the shelf. It draws straight to the panels (KMS) and loads ALSA at run time.
